00:40:47.881 --> 00:40:50.440
to know how the regularization
from different layer interact.

00:40:51.650 --> 00:40:53.330
So it's a little
black box there too.

00:40:53.331 --> 00:40:56.870
&gt;&gt; But is the basic idea
that you basically want

00:40:56.871 --> 00:40:59.950
to penalize some kind of-
&gt;&gt; I think it's one way

00:40:59.951 --> 00:41:02.800
