00:48:38.791 --> 00:48:41.386
Actually, the neurons that
have fired when you were

00:48:41.387 --> 00:48:44.573
thinking about whatever you were
previously thinking about and

00:48:44.574 --> 00:48:46.461
then some new neurons
are firing, and

00:48:46.462 --> 00:48:48.010
that's a synaptic response.

00:48:48.011 --> 00:48:50.900
So this response is receding as
the other one is raising, so

00:48:50.901 --> 00:48:54.050
there is some sort of
mixture model happening.

00:48:54.051 --> 00:48:57.070
I'm just wondering if you've
