00:49:09.121 --> 00:49:10.280
you write something.

00:49:10.281 --> 00:49:13.223
Some people can do this, but
there's a lot of work that shows

00:49:13.224 --> 00:49:15.256
that you only sort of
have one processor.

00:49:15.257 --> 00:49:18.921
But I don't know for sort of
subconscious thought or just in

00:49:18.922 --> 00:49:22.381
our own mind when we think
about experiences or images.

00:49:22.382 --> 00:49:26.137
And we're trying to reflect that
