an experiment.

00:49:46.519 --> 00:49:48.481
So I think that's
a bigger problem and

00:49:48.482 --> 00:49:49.985
your mind went off, right?

00:49:49.986 --> 00:49:54.130
You're looking at it but
you're really not seeing it.

00:49:54.131 --> 00:49:55.691
And before,
the tension definitely played

00:49:55.692 --> 00:49:56.288
a role already.

00:49:56.289 --> 00:49:59.064
But I think what you
were saying though,

00:49:59.065 --> 00:50:02.985
I felt like you need a lot more
precise measurement than we

00:50:02.986 --> 00:50:04.956
