00:50:04.957 --> 00:50:05.574
&gt;&gt; Yeah.

00:50:05.575 --> 00:50:09.001
&gt;&gt; Yeah, I think, I don't know,
people talking about 17, but

00:50:09.002 --> 00:50:12.313
